# CQ5 — Which simulated property values of a glass were compared against which
#        analysis-process (assay) results?
#
# STATUS: DRAFT (PLAN Step 3; assay-result provenance corrected 2026-08-27 per
#         the independent post-integration review — WORK_LOG.md Entry 29).
#         Syntax-checked only; NOT an executed validation result. Execution
#         belongs to Steps 7-8 (blocked by D-021).
# SOURCE: PLAN.md §6 CQ5; documented instance paths: PLAN.md §7.4.1 patterns 2-3,
#         MODELING.md §5.2-§5.3 (required form of 2026-08-27).
# PATH:   validation occurrence (obo:OBI_0302911) --obo:OBI_0000293--> BOTH the
#         simulated property datum (go:GO_0000318) AND the measurement datum
#         (obo:IAO_0000109); the simulated/measured distinction is carried by
#         TYPING, never by a naming convention. REQUIRED shared-property bridge:
#         both compared data are obo:IAO_0000136 about the SAME property
#         instance; the assay obo:RO_0009006-measures that property instance
#         AND has the compared measurement datum as its obo:OBI_0000299
#         specified output.
# PROVENANCE REQUIREMENT (corrected 2026-08-27): the integrated draft left the
#         property/assay bridge OPTIONAL and never linked the assay to the
#         measurement datum - a validation with no assay-produced result still
#         counted as an answer, and an assay measuring the property could be
#         paired with a measurement datum it never produced. The draft now
#         REQUIRES the selected assay to have produced the exact measurement
#         datum consumed by the validation (?assay obo:OBI_0000299 ?measDatum;
#         domain-compatible: obo:OBI_0000299 has domain obo:COB_0000035 planned
#         process, and assays are planned processes) and REQUIRES both compared
#         data items to be about the shared property instance. A validation
#         whose measured input lacks assay provenance is NOT a CQ5 answer -
#         that is what "compared against analysis-process results" means.
# EXPECTED ANSWER COLUMNS:
#         ?validation  - the validation occurrence
#         ?simDatum    - simulated property datum (typed go:GO_0000318)
#         ?measDatum   - measurement datum (typed obo:IAO_0000109), specified
#                        output of ?assay
#         ?property ?propertyClass - the shared property instance and its class
#         ?assay ?assayClass       - the analysis process and its class
#                                    (subclass of obo:OBI_0000070 "assay")
# FIXTURE REQUIREMENTS (Step 7, corrected 2026-08-27 - all REQUIRED):
#         one validation joining the simulated density datum (thesis §2.2.5)
#         and a BAM density measurement datum (thesis ch. 4); the assay typed
#         with the existing baseline class GO_0000058 "Density analyzing
#         process" (subclass of obo:OBI_0000070, verified); AND the assertions
#           ex:assay-001            obo:OBI_0000299 ex:meas-density-datum-001 .
#           ex:sim-density-datum-001  obo:IAO_0000136 ex:density-001 .
#           ex:meas-density-datum-001 obo:IAO_0000136 ex:density-001 .
#         (MODELING.md §6.1).
# GRAPH ASSUMPTION: expected answers assume the ASSERTED graph only -
#         rdfs:subClassOf* traverses asserted subclass axioms; no OWL reasoning
#         (including owl:equivalentClass-based classification) is assumed or
#         claimed; D-021 is pending, so no reasoning result may be claimed.
# LIMITS: viscosity comparisons wait for the D-017 repair - GO_0000046 is
#         trapped inside the runaway skos:definition literal of GO_0000018 and
#         is NOT a usable declared class until the repair is approved and
#         executed (MODELING.md §3). Graded agreement and named metric data
#         (screening Batches 1-6) are documented as instance-level additions in
#         MODELING.md §8.6 - a metric datum can be attached as a further
#         specified output of ?validation without new classes; the draft does
#         not require it.

PREFIX rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX obo:  <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/>
PREFIX co:   <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/>
PREFIX go:   <https://w3id.org/pmd/glass-ontology/>

SELECT DISTINCT ?validation ?simDatum ?measDatum ?property ?propertyClass ?assay ?assayClass
WHERE {
  ?validation rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* obo:OBI_0302911 .   # validation
  ?validation obo:OBI_0000293 ?simDatum , ?measDatum .      # has specified input (both data)

  ?simDatum  rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* go:GO_0000318 .      # simulated property datum
  ?measDatum rdf:type/rdfs:subClassOf* obo:IAO_0000109 .    # measurement datum
  FILTER (?simDatum != ?measDatum)

  ?simDatum  obo:IAO_0000136 ?property .                    # is about - REQUIRED: both compared
  ?measDatum obo:IAO_0000136 ?property .                    # data are about the SAME property instance
  ?property  rdf:type ?propertyClass .

  ?assay obo:RO_0009006  ?property .                        # assay measures characteristic
  ?assay obo:OBI_0000299 ?measDatum .                       # REQUIRED: the assay produced the exact
                                                            # measurement datum consumed by the validation
  ?assay rdf:type ?assayClass .
  ?assayClass rdfs:subClassOf* obo:OBI_0000070 .            # assay
}
ORDER BY ?validation ?simDatum
